# head/adult/man/brow_straight: the man's straight brows (A3): 2 px over each eye in hair step 1
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role brow straight
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
tags mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -4 -8
|bb....bb

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -11 -8
|bb

view L key rest origin -3 -8
|bb
